cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the release version used. See README.md for a suggested citation
  and acknowledgments of the original Census Bureau and BLS data.
type: dataset
title: Harmonized Historical ACS Measures
authors:
  - name: Harmonized Historical ACS Measures contributors
url: https://github.com/geomarker-io/hh_acs_measures
repository-code: https://github.com/geomarker-io/hh_acs_measures
abstract: >-
  Thirty measures of population, socioeconomic conditions, and housing derived
  from American Community Survey five-year estimates for census tracts in the
  50 states and District of Columbia, 2010-2024, with 90% margins of error.
  Measure definitions are harmonized across years; geographic boundaries are not.
